    {
      "id": "claim_cd136c77cd234720aac91fda88b6a998",
      "statement": "hx-app-lib.sh provides the shared helpers every 10-*.sh block composes: hx_app_user (dedicated system user with nologin shell + home), hx_app_venv (venv + pinned PyPI install as the service user), hx_app_unit (write/enable/start a Type=simple systemd unit with env lines), hx_app_validate (wait for TCP port up to 60x5s then systemctl is-active/is-enabled), hx_app_done (closing note; NONE unit requires a reboot-check command instead of a unit name), and hx_node_install (Node.js from nodejs.org binary tarball, SHA-verified against SHASUMS256.txt, idempotent).",
