    {
      "id": "claim_e6a99cde2df54662a53f4a6f27f29eff",
      "statement": "hx_fetch_verified downloads an artifact and refuses it unless its SHA-256 matches the pin, exiting 30 on a missing pin, a download failure, or a checksum mismatch, and removing the failed artifact so no later step can pick it up. It exists because .coderabbit.yaml flagged that only 10-postgresql.sh verified a tarball and everything else accepted whatever the server sent, and a release asset can be replaced in place.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/03-runbooks/common/10-qdrant.sh#L20-L22",
