    {
      "id": "claim_bc62d78ca6e143acbe8f891988228f27",
      "statement": "The canonical fleet unit from hx_app_unit is Type=simple, After/Wants=network-online.target, Restart=on-failure, RestartSec=5, TimeoutStartSec=600, WantedBy=multi-user.target, with services binding 0.0.0.0 per D-018. PostgreSQL is the lone Type=notify unit (with KillSignal=SIGINT and ExecReload via HUP); NGINX is Type=forking with PIDFile and ExecStartPre=nginx -t; the base Ollama unit written by hx_ollama_install is byte-for-byte the vendor installer's unit (Restart=always, WantedBy=default.target) with server settings in a drop-in.",
