    {
      "id": "claim_a83e726cb94a46ff8a88527eb5cb7906",
      "statement": "The HX-4 reranker block pins the BGE cross-encoder model (BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3) to an immutable commit revision so a later upstream edit cannot change the model under a stable name, serves it via infinity-emb from PyPI (torch,server extras) under systemd with TimeoutStartSec=900, and polls /health for up to 90x10s because first start downloads the model.",
