      "id": "claim_2423b66aae484c54a6bb9f4f7fe3dcbf",
      "statement": "Blocks that install a library or CLI (Crawl4AI, Deep Agents, Docling, FastMCP, Mem0) pass NONE to hx_app_done, which requires a reboot-check command instead of a unit name, because those components have no daemon and a systemctl is-active against a non-existent unit can only fail. Mem0 additionally exits 3 with an operator-decision NOTE because whether it runs inside the MCP server or a local FastAPI service is not yet decided, refusing to report a hx-mem0 unit nothing creates.",
