      "statement": "Block 03 refuses to run unless /srv/ollama is mounted (exit 20) and empty (exit 21) and HX_OLLAMA_VERSION is set (exit 30), then installs pinned Ollama via hx_ollama_install and writes the server-specific drop-in storage.conf setting OLLAMA_MODELS=/srv/ollama/models, OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0:11434, and OLLAMA_NO_CLOUD=1; 90-ollama-upgrade.sh upgrades a closed server to the fleet pin and is safe to re-run because it leaves the drop-in and /srv/ollama alone so models are not re-downloaded.",
