      "statement": "Several guards defend against reporting false success: OmniRoute and n8n resolve the actual binary path with command -v and exit 30 if missing (a previous || true hid failed installs); Crawl4AI confirms the resolved Playwright matches the pin (exit 30) and runs crawl4ai-doctor without || true so it can fail; PostgreSQL confirms listen_addresses is an active value (sed reports success on no match) and guards the pg_hba rule against matching a commented-out line.",
